WEBVTT

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.860
<i>I can hear a voice.</i>

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:13.300
<i>I'm... overflowing with power!</i>

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.780
Eradicate misfortune!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.800
What...

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.240
What happened to me?!

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.390
<i>Well, no matter.</i>

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:43.080
<i>I don't know what this power is,</i>

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.810
<i>and I don't know from whence it came.</i>

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.860
<i>All my senses are honed to perfection.</i>

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.030
<i>I can easily pinpoint the 
location of the mana crystals.</i>

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.910
With this power, I can defeat Jahy!

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.610
Just you wait!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.320
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.440
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.650
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.820
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.990
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:17.220
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:36.490
<b>Restoration Plan No. 18

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.930
I've found you at last!

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.600
Today's the day, Jahy! The day I end you!

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.820
Has my form rendered you speechless?

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.970
Who the hell are you?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.950
Don't tell me you forgot me...

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.480
Are you saying we know each other?

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.490
I don't know anyone like you, though...

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.520
D-Don't trifle with me! Remember already!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:10.840
Come on, come on.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:16.750
Oh, right, you're that depressed person

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.090
I cheered up at the park that one time.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.100
Wait, that little kid was you?!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.920
Wow, what a coincidence!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.420
So, you feeling better now?

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:30.020
I—

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.060
Hold it right there!

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.800
Making small talk is nice,

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.940
but that's not what you were 
supposed to remember!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.520
Come on! Doesn't this outfit give it away?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.500
Oh, I know!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.240
Your outfit...

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.700
<i>is</i> pretty weird.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.910
Look who's talking!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.720
I know what that is.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.370
It's called cosplay, right?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.740
No!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.340
I'm steamed you're learning
 stuff in the human world!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:00.600
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it all!
Damn! Damn! Damn! Damn! Damn!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.600
Now that I look at you, 
you're face <i>does</i> seem familiar.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.340
Do you finally remember?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:02.930
I'm—

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.270
Wait. It's on the tip of my tongue.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.890
I'm just on the brink of remembering.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.420
I've nearly got it, so don't tell me.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.100
Sau...ru...

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.420
You were...

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.070
the Dark Realm's... let's see, uh...

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.530
<i>Come on, remember! Remember!</i>

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.030
<i>Remember the Magnificent Saurva,
who's coming for your position!</i>

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.910
It started with... S...

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:29.710
Sa...

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.430
Say, I don't remember at all.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.370
What?!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.290
Who are you?

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:38.250
<i>Back in the Dark Realm...</i>

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.550
<i>and here in the human world...</i>

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:46.510
<i>so many horrible things happened 
to me, all because of her.</i>

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.970
<i>Does this mean she never 
even realized I was there?!</i>

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:53.430
<i>Damn you, Jahy...!</i>

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:57.010
How much more must you belittle 
me before you're satisfied?!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.660
My name is Saurva!

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:04.220
I'm going to defeat you and become 
the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.030
Fight me!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.530
You're crying...

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.370
I am not!

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:14.620
I'm going to get you back for 
all the times you humiliated me!

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.460
How, you ask?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:17.880
Well...

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.970
I've been given power!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:26.970
I shall defeat you and rule the Dark Realm.

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.470
What is that light?

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.220
Aren't you a denizen of the Dark Realm?

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.170
Indeed.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.900
I am Saurva, third most powerful 
being of the Dark Realm...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.470
But now...

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.690
I suppose I'm a warrior of the light, 
wielding the power of light!

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.030
The light?

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.070
Are you talking about the 
power the Magical Girl has?!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.210
You! How did you get your power?

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.610
What is your relationship 
to the magical girl?

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.330
Where and when did you meet her?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:59.070
<i>Even now, you aren't looking at me?!</i>

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.240
Do you want to know?

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:03.710
Fine...

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.430
Defeat me and I'll tell you.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.270
Well? How was that move?

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:33.410
Th-That...

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:36.320
My shoulder's not stiff anymore.

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.750
Are you messing with me?!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:41.460
That was just a little warm-up.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.960
Here comes the real thing!

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.700
H-How'd you like that...?

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:14.740
That tickled.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.870
What?!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.710
It didn't do anything?

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.770
But I thought I was overflowing with power!

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.880
Oh, that itches! That itches!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.960
Maybe because that improved my circulation...

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:32.440
<i>Didn't the voice from the light
say it was granting me power?</i>

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.260
<i>It didn't do anything!</i>

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.380
<i>So what was all that about?</i>

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:38.430
<i>When I got stabbed by the light?</i>

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.430
<i>Wait, so this sword...</i>

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:42.950
<i>All it does is light up?</i>

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.650
<i>It doesn't feel like I cut anything.</i>

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.510
<i>And why did my clothes change color?</i>

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.360
<i>Isn't this basically just a makeover?!</i>

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.970
<i>What gives?!</i>

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:59.540
I thought I'd grown powerful... 
grown strong...

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.250
Uh...

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.410
It's working! It's working!

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.000
You know what it probably is?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:14.010
I've also collected mana crystals here in 
the human realm and regained my powers.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:19.520
Actually, I'm more powerful now

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.060
than I was back in the Dark Realm.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:27.860
So you don't have to feel 
bad about yourself, Saurva.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.780
W-Wait!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.160
I still had some questions 
about that source of light!

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:44.080
Just you wait, Jahy!

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.020
The light...

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:50.810
It's gone.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.770
What was all that? Huh?!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.160
"I will grant you power," my butt!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.170
It didn't do squat!

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:02.540
Eek!

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:08.940
In the end, it went like it always does...

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.320
Wait!

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.950
I forced her to learn my name when

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:14.600
she didn't even know who I was before!

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:15.660
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.570
<i>Saurva.</i>

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.540
This is a pretty big development!

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:26.300
And next time, I'll beat her by my own power!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:30.150
<i>Somehow, Saurva managed to keep her chin up.</i>

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:33.030
Didn't do squat!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.030
Eek!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:37.490
Oh, hey, Kokoro!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.220
Are you done with school already?

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.680
Let's play until I have to go to work!

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.760
Kokoro! Want to...

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.740
K-Kokoro?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.530
Kokoro is ignoring me.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.880
Huh?

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:05.400
I thought you were being unnaturally docile.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.020
So that's the deal, huh?

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.830
Hey, this is a real emergency!

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.940
You probably just said or did 
something uncalled for again.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.200
I don't think I did...

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.670
It probably made her dislike you.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.390
Kokoro wouldn't dislike me!

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.350
You so sure?

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.040
Who is this Kokoro girl to you again?

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.920
This is the first I've heard of her.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:32.580
Oh, I guess I never told you about her.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.020
Kokoro is my...

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:37.690
Huh?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.530
My...

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:41.490
Huh?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:46.000
She's my friend...

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.260
What's so funny?!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.210
Nothing. You actually made a friend!

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:59.370
You'd normally say "underling," 
but you actually said "friend"!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.910
Th-That's right.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.890
Yup. She's my underling.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.390
But, you know,

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:10.050
Kokoro gets me.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:14.930
She honestly respects me 
and says what I need to hear.

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:20.110
Whenever I'm with her, 
I get this light feeling in my heart.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:25.320
Isn't that what you call a friend 
in the human world?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:31.290
So what you're saying is that you 
got into a fight with your friend?

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:33.500
A fight?

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.350
Oh, wait, you get into those 
all the time with your sister!

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.710
About the size of your boobs, 
the way you sleep,

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.570
the size of your boobs, your boobs—

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:41.560
Yeah, that!

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:43.510
So sue me!

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.450
Anyway, Ja-ko...

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:49.250
Do you remember anything?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:50.960
Do you remember saying anything

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.060
that might've hurt or upset her?

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.010
<i>Me?</i>

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.990
<i>Hurt... Kokoro?</i>

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.740
<i>Great Jahy!</i>

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.550
<i>Great Jahy!</i>

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.950
<i>Me, hurt Kokoro?</i>

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.160
I would never do that!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.160
You big dummy!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.240
Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b>

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.210
How do you make up with a friend?

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.420
Indeed.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:26.640
I never thought I'd see the day 
you came ask me for this kind of advice!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.790
Red bean rice! I need to 
go make some red bean rice!

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.490
And we need a lion dance...

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:32.850
What the hell?!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.810
I'm really torn up about this!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.700
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.430
But if you want to make up with your friend,

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:47.180
why don't you just tell 
her how you're feeling?

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:49.400
What I'm feeling?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.740
Yes! It sounds so simple, 
but it's surprisingly difficult.

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:55.710
But...

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.540
I know you can do it now, Hy-chan.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.760
Good luck!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.100
Kokoro!

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.390
Kokoro!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.430
Kokoro!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.140
Kokoro!

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:27.560
Why are you avoiding me?

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.990
If I hurt you in any way, then I apologize.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:34.300
So...

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.210
So...

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.500
Please, let's make up.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.580
Gray...

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.840
Gray Lahy...

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:57.930
You're saying your tooth hurts 
so bad that you can't properly talk?

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.430
I don't want you to catch it

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:07.620
You were avoiding me because you 
don't want me to catch your bad tooth?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:16.280
Oh, thank goodness!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.790
Let's play

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.250
I'll fix my tooth

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.990
You want to play a lot 
once your tooth is better?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.430
Of course!

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:42.260
<i>The Great Jahy completely
opened her heart to Kokoro.</i>

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:48.830
<i>Now, relieved of that great crisis,
the Great Jahy still has</i>

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.000
<i>one more thing to take care of...</i>

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:55.730
<i>That weird, fuzzy light 
that came out of her...</i>

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.010
<i>What exactly </i>was<i> that?</i>

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:06.750
<b>Maou.</b>

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.700
Seriously, there too?

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.460
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.760
Hy-chan!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:10.590
Hy-chan, have you ever seen a ghost?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.380
A ghost?

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.140
Actually, do you know what a ghost is?

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:19.030
It's the soul of a dead person 
that's left their body.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.350
A dead person?

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:22.180
Yeah, that's right.

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:24.460
Those who've still got 
something left for them here,

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.770
or those with some kind of axe to grind.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:29.240
Sounds stupid.

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.710
As if something that zany could be real.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.950
That has absolutely zero believability
coming out of Ja-ko's mouth.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.410
And? So what's this about ghosts?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.820
There've been rumors going 
around the neighborhood lately.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.350
Yeah, yeah.

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:49.420
Even some of our guests have talked 
about hearing a ghostly voice.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:53.750
And apparently, the ghost never shows itself.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:57.600
It just asks out of nowhere,
 "Do you want power?"

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:02.030
Then, if you find yourself thinking "yes,"

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:03.860
your soul is pulled from your body.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:09.190
Your body turns blueish white
 and you, too, become a ghost.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.970
Yeah, right!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.570
That doesn't sound scary at all.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.270
I-It's just talk, right?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:22.540
But even you talked about it once.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.470
Remember? You said you kept hearing

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.750
noises from the empty room next to yours.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:31.930
When I went to investigate, 
the doors and the windows were locked,

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:35.180
but I could still tell that 
someone had been inside.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.550
What did you just say?!

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:40.110
The people in the shopping 
district have seen it, too.

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:45.520
Pale people without their souls, 
wandering around hungering for others'...

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:49.980
I haven't seen the customer 
who told me this story since.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.310
An old lady in our neighborhood

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:53.540
hasn't been feeling so well after seeing it...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.660
That's right! I'm so worried about her!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.970
Uh...huh...

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.380
<i>It feels like something's there...</i>

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.400
<i>I kinda think I heard a voice.</i>

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.830
Hmph, this is stupid.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.690
Ghosts? Yeah, right.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.090
Silly...

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:36.780
O-O-Oh, it was just the wind...

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.240
That scared me.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:43.910
Besides, I'm the Great Jahy,
second-in-command of the Dark Realm!

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:47.340
If a ghost tries to mess with me,

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.880
I'll just strike back with my powers!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.920
Come and get it!

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.580
<b>Anteater stance!!</b>

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.590
I'll send you screaming for the hills!

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.760
There's nothing that scary—

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:07.440
Who could it be at this hour...?

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.170
The landlord!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.400
That's it! She probably came to scare me!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.450
I know it's you!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:22.190
Sheesh. Well, if you just had to...

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:36.500
I know I heard something.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:39.030
<i>But...</i>

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.140
<i>there's no one here...</i>

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:44.920
Landlord!

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:46.130
Boss!

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.150
Please come!

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.020
Someone!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.450
Anyone!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.210
Hy-chan, have you ever seen a ghost?

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.860
There've been rumors going 
around the neighborhood lately.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.460
Do you want power?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:14.010
<i>It just asks out of nowhere,
 "Do you want power?"</i>

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:19.380
<i>Then, if you find yourself thinking "yes,"
your soul is pulled from your body.</i>

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.220
No! I don't want it! 
I don't want it!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:25.930
I don't want even a smidgen of power!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.550
I see.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:30.770
What the?

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:32.970
It's not doing anything to me.

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:35.980
Is this not the ghost, then?

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:39.850
I'm getting a vibe 
similar to the magical girl.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:42.950
It never shows itself,
it only talks to you...

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:44.370
Are you...

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.620
Then give back the mana crystal!

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:51.330
...the one pulling the magical girl's strings?

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:54.880
To my real form!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.300
Crap! There's not enough time!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:59.800
Am I gonna lose my mana crystal again?!

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.820
Druj?!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:10.980
Are you all right, Your Greatness?

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.940
<i>I can't! Not in front of my underling.</i>

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:20.740
Druj, what are you doing here?

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.700
I heard talk of the pale ghost 
and I've been chasing after it.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.300
Such rumors always have something to do

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:32.670
either with the magical girl
or a denizen of the Dark Realm.

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:37.040
I was thinking the same thing!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.130
<i>Totally wasn't.</i>

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:45.020
Then just as I thought,
 you came to town to lure it out.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:46.640
Yeah... That's right.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.600
Of course you would, Your Greatness!

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.390
Now then,

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:54.950
what are we going to do with that thing?

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:58.130
<i>It's capable of controlling the magical girl.</i>

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:01.080
<i>I don't know if my power is any match for it.</i>

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.330
<i>But I don't want Druj</i>

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:07.260
<i>to be disillusioned!</i>

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.610
Druj.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:19.030
Y-Yes?

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:31.330
Can I count on you this one time?

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.810
Of course, Your Greatness!

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:42.110
Let us join forces, then.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.480
Huh? Huh?!

00:23:19.020 --> 01:00:00.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:19.020 --> 01:00:00.000
<b>The Demon Lord Is Relentless?!</b>
